("audit.bootstrap", "boundary", "Node, captured-byte loader, primitive evaluator, typed REL codec and pinned bootstrap-only syntax reader remain explicit native trust. Encounter re-parses the bootstrap, hydrates actual REL, links and admits the operative image. Self-correspondence is not an independent proof of compiler correctness.")
("audit.native-regexp", "boundary", "Only pinned trusted compiler/surface policy uses synchronous fixed regex patterns. Application regex ports are replaced by isolated worker operations. This is not a claim of universal native heap or wall-clock isolation.")
("audit.transport", "boundary", "Existing JSON HTTP wire data and primitive equality serialization convey no programme authority; no JSON files or object programme loaders are admitted.")
